@node Effective Key Bindings
@section Effective Key Bindings
@cindex key bindings, generated
@cindex effective keymap

These tables are generated from each view's @emph{effective} keymap
(`keymap-lookup' over the mode's map, local bindings over inherited ones).
A key a view binds is listed with the command it runs; an unbound key is
omitted.  The semantic contract behind these tables is
@code{gascity-key-registry-test}; @xref{Key Index}, for the alphabetical index.

